== 展开证书 ==
aethercert 1
vars x
start (pow (add (var x) (num 1)) 2)
same (add (pow (var x) 2) (add (mul (num 2) (var x)) (num 1)))
claim (add (pow (var x) 2) (add (mul (num 2) (var x)) (num 1)))
end

== 求导证书 ==
aethercert 1
vars x
start (add (pow (var x) 3) (mul (num 2) (var x)))
diff x (add (mul (num 3) (pow (var x) 2)) (num 2))
claim (add (mul (num 3) (pow (var x) 2)) (num 2))
end

== 链式法则 ==
aethercert 1
vars x
start (fn sin (pow (var x) 2))
diff x (mul (num 2) (mul (var x) (fn cos (pow (var x) 2))))
claim (mul (num 2) (mul (var x) (fn cos (pow (var x) 2))))
end

== 判等证书 ==
aethercert 1
vars x
start (pow (add (var x) (num 1)) 2)
claim (add (pow (var x) 2) (add (mul (num 2) (var x)) (num 1)))
end

== 精度：超出 double 的整数应被拒绝 ==
拒绝: 整数 1e+17 超出 double 精确范围，证书无法如实表示
== 精度：非证书白名单函数应被拒绝（abs 不在证书支持的 12 个函数里）==
拒绝: 函数 abs 不在证书白名单内
